<title>NEW ZEALAND: Richina reports $1.27 mln yr net profit.</title>
<headline>Richina reports $1.27 mln yr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Note - the company said its six month result was being reported as a full period result following Richina's recent change in balance date to December from June.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1.27 vs 0.23</p>
